            <p class="mt-8 max-w-[42ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.5] text-dark-2">
              Lighting, shade, audio, and control share one processor topology. The ledger below is the same class of information we hand to architects and framers before drywall.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 max-w-[42ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.5] text-dark-2">
              Pocket depth is not cosmetic. Undersize it and the fabric roll binds against trim within a season. The numbers are the work.
            </p>
